      "behaviour": "Bit 7 resets the timer flags and the interrupt, and while it is set the write ignores all the other bits, so 0x81 does not start timer 1. With bit 7 clear, bit 6 masks timer 1, bit 5 masks timer 2, bit 1 starts timer 2 and bit 0 starts timer 1.",
